  "captions": [
    {
      "duration_frames": 120,
      "from_frame": 0,
      "text": "Free software still needs someone to own the workflow."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 120,
      "text": "Suppose a tool prepares your weekly update. The software price is only one box on the checklist."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 330,
      "text": "Check whether it needs hosting, paid model calls, setup work, or access to team information."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 540,
      "text": "Then name the person who checks the output and the person who handles a failed run."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 210,
      "from_frame": 750,
      "text": "For this first test, keep the result as a draft. A failure should not publish an update."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 960,
      "text": "We are not comparing prices here. These are questions to answer before choosing the setup."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1140,
      "text": "A simple tool with clear ownership may suit your task. You still need to test that fit."
    },
    {
      "duration_frames": 180,
      "from_frame": 1320,
      "text": "Before installing anything, fill in three fields: running needs, reviewer, and failure owner."
    }
  ],
